    "body": "# Stop Hardcoding Your Portfolio: Supercharge Your Site with portfolioCMS\n\nAre you still digging into your *React* and *Tailwind CSS* source code every time you need to add a new project, update your bio, or publish a blog post? For frontend developers, maintaining a personal portfolio often becomes a tedious chore of pushing commits and waiting for redeployments just to fix a typo. \n\nEnter **[portfolioCMS](https://portfoliocms.vinaysikarwar.me/)**—a headless CMS and API built specifically to turn your static frontend into a dynamic, effortlessly managed portfolio.\n\n## The End of Hardcoded Data\n\nWhether you are building your UI with React, Next.js, or Astro, portfolioCMS acts as your single source of truth. Instead of maintaining giant local JSON files or markdown documents in your repository, you get an intuitive visual dashboard to manage your projects, blog posts, documents, and media library without writing a single line of code.\n\n## Instant API Integration\n\nThe standout feature of portfolioCMS is its developer-friendly simplicity. With a single API call to endpoints like `/api/v1/your-api-slug/projects`, you receive structured JSON data instantly. This means:\n* **Zero server rebuilds:** Your edits reflect on your live website in real time.\n* **Instant cache revalidation:** Keep your site fast while ensuring visitors always see your latest work.\n\n## Built for Edge Performance\n\nSpeed is critical for a developer's portfolio, and portfolioCMS delivers enterprise-grade performance out of the box:\n* **<35ms Global Edge Latency:** Lightning-fast API responses worldwide.\n* **100% Framework Agnostic:** Seamlessly syncs with whatever frontend stack you prefer.\n* **0ms Cold-Start Overhead:** Powered by an infrastructure that ensures a 99.9% edge cache hit ratio.\n\n## Ready to Upgrade Your Workflow?\n\nIt’s time to focus on designing digital products with impact and stop wrestling with content updates. With flexible plans starting at just *$9.99/month* (ideal for indie developers managing a single portfolio), taking control of your data has never been easier. \n\nNever hardcode your portfolio data again. Connect your frontend in minutes and let portfolioCMS handle the rest.",
